@startuml
title W3 — SO29 / CO29 Record telephone offer outcome
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Administrative Staff" as Staff
participant ":AppointmentTrackingSystem" as System
note over Staff : Staff telephones a candidate outside the software.
Staff -> System : recordWaitlistOfferOutcome(entry, slot, medicalService,\noutcome, removeIfDeclined)
alt valid current entry, opening, service and outcome
  alt outcome = ACCEPTED; removeIfDeclined = false
    System --> Staff : offer recorded; proceed to ordinary UC1 booking
    ref over Staff, System : UC1 / SO02 rechecks and books only on explicit selection
  else outcome = DECLINED; removeIfDeclined = true
    System --> Staff : offer recorded; entry REMOVED
  else outcome = DECLINED; removeIfDeclined = false
    System --> Staff : offer recorded; entry remains WAITING
  end
else stale/ineligible selection or invalid outcome/removal combination
  System --> Staff : rejection reason; no offer or entry change
end
note over System : SO29 never reserves or books a slot.
@enduml
